cort targets under fire.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Destruction</strong>: Plant charges in enemy locations and make a hasty escape.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Data Breach</strong>: Hack fortified networks for classified intel and evade countermeasures.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3721020/extras/eecf9071ba13f44d9761ddf0e7e1db54.poster.avif?t=1747914945\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3721020/extras/eecf9071ba13f44d9761ddf0e7e1db54.webm?t=1747914945\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3721020/extras/eecf9071ba13f44d9761ddf0e7e1db54.mp4?t=1747914945\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Factions &amp; Reputation</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your actions sway rival powers. Unlock each faction\u2019s exclusive Black Market in the Crypt Exchange\u2014where rare gear awaits\u2026 at a cost.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Economy &amp; Progression</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Crypts</strong>: Earn from contracts, spend on weapons, hardware upgrades, and your ship.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>XP &amp; Upgrades</strong>: Gain new software skills each mission\u2014permanent progression ensures every playthrough counts.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Heat vs. Policing</strong>: Higher-risk contracts pay more but spike your heat. Galactic authorities and faction police will hunt you down if your heat gets too high\u2014plan accordingly.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3721020/extras/4302d94cad0ec813677cba3b8eba98a1.poster.avif?t=1747914945\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3721020/extras/4302d94cad0ec813677cba3b8eba98a1.webm?t=1747914945\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3721020/extras/4302d94cad0ec813677cba3b8eba98a1.mp4?t=1747914945\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Ship Hub</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your ship is your HQ: use the onboard console to browse contracts and invest Crypts in hardware upgrades that enhance your bounty-hunting capabilities.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Playtest &amp; Wishlist</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We\u2019re actively shaping the upcoming Steam demo\u2014your feedback matters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25b6\ufe0f <strong>Wishlist Galactic Bounty</strong> to stay up to date with development and be first in line for the demo.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3721020/extras/4699d2682401907880a9fc0bd15e0845.poster.avif?t=1747914945\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3721020/extras/4699d2682401907880a9fc0bd15e0845.webm?t=1747914945\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3721020/extras/4699d2682401907880a9fc0bd15e0845.mp4?t=1747914945\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
